                    {
                        "form_id": "563a77f8-eb3a-4026-a553-727783554097",
                        "entry_id": "8bb692ea-826f-363d-997e-373463109c25",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ро́сстани"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f773be14-531b-4e2d-97ca-b79f0de983ad",
                        "entry_id": "8bb692ea-826f-363d-997e-373463109c25",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ро́сстанях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fb2146c2-106c-3c34-8b1c-d11a5218445e",
                        "entry_id": "8bb692ea-826f-363d-997e-373463109c25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "нар.-разг. перекрёсток двух или нескольких дорог; распутье"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4f0f049-93d9-48a1-9dea-5764b4783080",
                                "sense_id": "fb2146c2-106c-3c34-8b1c-d11a5218445e",
                                "text": "Перепуганные богомолки бросились в лес, а на росстани остались одни мужики."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "534ff6ca-1c20-45c4-9f95-b357ba9ed895",
                                "sense_id": "fb2146c2-106c-3c34-8b1c-d11a5218445e",
                                "text": "За воротами, не глядя друг на друга, устремились в разные стороны, хоть обоим надо одним переулком идти ― до росстани."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6f5c010-0506-3b13-a48b-03e1d0ad5590",
                        "entry_id": "8bb692ea-826f-363d-997e-373463109c25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., поэт. ситуация, при которой приходится делать выбор"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2bc53934-01f0-4ee1-919e-ee1548587676",
                                "sense_id": "b6f5c010-0506-3b13-a48b-03e1d0ad5590",
                                "text": "А это было то событие, где большинство христиан отреклось от своей веры; это были те росстани, где огромное большинство пошло с христианским именем по языческой дороге и идёт до сих пор."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be6d15c2-d204-34e6-910c-aaf68a27347c",
                        "entry_id": "8bb692ea-826f-363d-997e-373463109c25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., поэт. ситуация, при которой приходится делать выбор"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f200b87-2b4e-4fb1-92a6-b1f7b0d01558",
                                "sense_id": "be6d15c2-d204-34e6-910c-aaf68a27347c",
                                "text": "Судьба замедлила сурово, // На росстани лесных дорог… // Я ждал и отойти не мог, // Я шел и возвращался снова…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8667c0e7-50e1-4c12-b407-27a1b69676a3",
                        "source_entry_id": "8bb692ea-826f-363d-997e-373463109c25",
                        "target_lang_word": "crossroads",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "crossroads",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aae2f9bb-b926-384a-a625-098ed3399dbf",
                                        "entry_id": "700823ae-f27b-3cce-b2f5-475c7ff73800",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "plural of crossroad"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "crossroads",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e54552c1-a6e7-3348-bd6f-2eb18c586aaf",
                                        "entry_id": "b48ec279-0170-3bd8-a388-cdaec01b7ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where one road crosses another; an intersection of two or more roads."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26614a4f-2f24-4e4e-9c9a-65603bf32b14",
                                                "sense_id": "e54552c1-a6e7-3348-bd6f-2eb18c586aaf",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: intersection"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "618efa7d-614d-4c35-9284-398865bb871c",
                                                "sense_id": "e54552c1-a6e7-3348-bd6f-2eb18c586aaf",
                                                "text": "When they came to a crossroads where the road split off into four cardinal directions, Stanton stood squinting up at the signpost for a long time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03d6b7df-0c5a-30f5-b129-5943d0f29c49",
                                        "entry_id": "b48ec279-0170-3bd8-a388-cdaec01b7ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A centrally located position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2db0dbb-51a2-4309-bebd-e0d73beb54ba",
                                                "sense_id": "03d6b7df-0c5a-30f5-b129-5943d0f29c49",
                                                "text": "The shiny wet black triangle at the crossroads of where her legs split."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10eff4e5-a2b2-4ba4-b759-6d3ad97501b4",
                                                "sense_id": "03d6b7df-0c5a-30f5-b129-5943d0f29c49",
                                                "text": "Together they control the approaches to this important railway crossroads from Chester, Crewe, Wolverhampton, Hereford and Machynlleth, and the station itself via an unusual mix of semaphore and colour light signals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02c7ad57-6e37-302d-89bd-e15b788aef1a",
                                        "entry_id": "b48ec279-0170-3bd8-a388-cdaec01b7ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A decision point; a turning point or opportunity to change a direction, a course, or a goal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f037eca2-6bf8-48a6-8e25-d7a3650e69d6",
                                                "sense_id": "02c7ad57-6e37-302d-89bd-e15b788aef1a",
                                                "text": "Well Russia at the present time is at a crossroads. It is often said that the Cold War is over and that the West has won it- that's only half true. Because what has happened is that the communists have been defeated, but the ideas of freedom now are on trial. If they don't work, there will be a reversion to, not communism which has failed, but what I call a new despotism which would pose a mortal danger to the rest of the world because it would be infected with the virus of Russian imperialism which of course has been a characteristic of Russian foreign policy for centuries."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d166680-bc56-3ef8-b57a-7f004e68ec69",
                                        "entry_id": "b48ec279-0170-3bd8-a388-cdaec01b7ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fork in the road."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "nonstandard"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7813da86-17bf-4aa7-a3a7-4957d45ab943",
                                                "sense_id": "4d166680-bc56-3ef8-b57a-7f004e68ec69",
                                                "text": "But first he stopped his car at the crossroads where the highway forked off to Gastmann's house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c533c61-d1af-4bf1-a24f-4a043327e361",
                                                "sense_id": "4d166680-bc56-3ef8-b57a-7f004e68ec69",
                                                "text": "The Company A commander, Captain Helmer, was at the crossroads where the road split, with the left fork leading to Udenbreth, when he saw a group of men coming toward him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fa761aa-e820-4562-bf82-04675b3832a4",
                                                "sense_id": "4d166680-bc56-3ef8-b57a-7f004e68ec69",
                                                "text": "When she reached the crossroads where the trail split, one part of her yearned to head toward the lake."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
